  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe value of ((275 × 275 × 275 + 725 × 725 × 725))/((275 × 275 + 725 × 725 - 725 × 275)) × ((275 × 275 × 275 - 725 × 725 × 725))/((275 × 275 + 725 × 725 + 725 × 275)) is:\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a³ + b³) = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)\n\n(a³ - b³) = (a - b)(a² + ab + b²)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nLet a = 275 and b = 725\n\nNumerator 1: 275³ + 725³ = (275 + 725)(275² - 275 × 725 + 725²)\n\n⇒ Numerator 1 = 1000(275² - 275 × 725 + 725²)\n\nDenominator 1: 275² + 725² - 725 × 275\n\n⇒ Denominator 1 = (275² + 725² - 725 × 275)\n\nNumerator 2: 275³ - 725³ = (275 - 725)(275² + 275 × 725 + 725²)\n\n⇒ Numerator 2 = -450(275² + 275 × 725 + 725²)\n\nDenominator 2: 275² + 725² + 725 × 275\n\n⇒ Denominator 2 = (275² + 725² + 725 × 275)\n\n⇒ The value = (1000(275² - 275 × 725 + 725²))/(275² + 725² - 725 × 275) × (-450(275² + 275 × 725 + 725²))/(275² + 725² + 725 × 275)\n\n⇒ The value = 1000 × -450\n\n⇒ The value = -450000\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
